      "name": "knowledgeware",
      "source": "./plugins/knowledgeware",
      "description": "Style-driven deliverable suite: slide decks (PowerPoint or HTML), multi-page HTML knowledge bases, and diagrams/data charts (Mermaid, SVG, or draw.io) that all render from one shared brand/style registry. Works out of the box with 5 built-in styles; add your own brand once and every deliverable matches. A librarian agent keeps sites and decks current: what's due, update plans, and scheduled fact-check sweeps.",
      "version": "1.12.2",
